@model ChequeVerification.Web.ViewModels.Cheques.ChequeListViewModel
@using ChequeVerification.Web.ViewModels.Dashboard
@using ChequeVerification.Web.ViewModels.Shared
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Chèques";
    var headerActions = (User.IsInRole("Utilisateur") || User.IsInRole("Administrateur"))
        ? $"<a class=\"btn btn-outline-primary me-2\" href=\"{Url.Action("BatchImport", "Cheques")}\">Importer des chèques</a>"
          + $"<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"{Url.Action("Create", "Cheques")}\">Importer un chèque</a>"
        : null;
}

<partial name="_PageHeader" model='new PageHeaderViewModel { Eyebrow = "Opérations", Title = "Chèques", Subtitle = "Chèques importés et suivi de leur traitement.", ActionsHtml = headerActions }' />

@if (TempData["Success"] != null)
{
    <div class="alert alert-success alert-dismissible fade show" role="alert">
        @TempData["Success"]
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert" aria-label="Fermer"></button>
    </div>
}

<form method="get" asp-action="Index" class="app-search mb-3" role="search">
    <div class="input-group" style="max-width: 460px;">
        <label class="visually-hidden" for="chequeSearch">Rechercher un chèque</label>
        <input type="text" id="chequeSearch" name="search" value="@Model.SearchTerm" class="form-control"
               placeholder="Rechercher (n° chèque, client, compte...)" />
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">Rechercher</button>
        @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Model.SearchTerm))
        {
            <a asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">Réinitialiser</a>
        }
    </div>
</form>

<div class="card">
    <div class="table-responsive">
        <table class="table table-hover mb-0">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>N° chèque</th>
                    <th>Client</th>
                    <th>N° client</th>
                    <th>Compte</th>
                    <th>Statut</th>
                    <th>Importé le</th>
                    <th>Importé par</th>
                    <th><span class="visually-hidden">Action</span></th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                @if (Model.Cheques.Any())
                {
                    foreach (var c in Model.Cheques)
                    {
                        <tr>
                            <td class="record-id">@c.ChequeNumber</td>
                            <td><span class="record-primary">@c.CustomerFullName</span></td>
                            <td class="record-secondary">@c.CustomerNumber</td>
                            <td class="record-secondary">@c.AccountNumber</td>
                            <td>
                                <span class="badge @StatusDisplayHelper.ChequeStatusBadge(c.Status)">
                                    @StatusDisplayHelper.ChequeStatusLabel(c.Status)
                                </span>
                            </td>
                            <td class="cell-date">@c.UploadedAt.ToString("g")</td>
                            <td>@c.ImportedByFullName</td>
                            <td class="table-actions">
                                <a asp-action="Details" asp-route-id="@c.ChequeId" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">Détails</a>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    }
                }
                else
                {
                    <tr>
                        <td colspan="8" class="app-empty">Aucun chèque trouvé.</td>
                    </tr>
                }
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</div>

@if (Model.TotalPages > 1)
{
    <nav class="mt-3" aria-label="Pagination des chèques">
        <ul class="pagination">
            <li class="page-item @(Model.Page <= 1 ? "disabled" : "")">
                <a class="page-link" asp-action="Index" asp-route-search="@Model.SearchTerm" asp-route-page="@(Model.Page - 1)">Précédent</a>
            </li>
            @for (int p = 1; p <= Model.TotalPages; p++)
            {
                <li class="page-item @(p == Model.Page ? "active" : "")">
                    <a class="page-link" asp-action="Index" asp-route-search="@Model.SearchTerm" asp-route-page="@p">@p</a>
                </li>
            }
            <li class="page-item @(Model.Page >= Model.TotalPages ? "disabled" : "")">
                <a class="page-link" asp-action="Index" asp-route-search="@Model.SearchTerm" asp-route-page="@(Model.Page + 1)">Suivant</a>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </nav>
}

<p class="app-meta mt-2">@Model.TotalCount chèque(s) au total.</p>
